meta:
  origin:
    # Data product / Snapshot
    title: Yearbook of Immigration Statistics
    title_snapshot: Yearbook of Immigration Statistics 2024 - Lawful Permanent Residents
    description: |-
      The 2024 Yearbook of Immigration Statistics is a collection of tables about immigration for the fiscal year.

      The yearbook tables include data about:

      - Aliens who came to the United States. This includes lawful permanent residents, temporary visitors (nonimmigrants), refugees, asylees, and naturalizations.
      - Immigration enforcement actions, including alien apprehensions, removals, and returns.
    description_snapshot: |-
      This workbook contains the Lawful Permanent Residents tables of the 2024 Yearbook (Tables 1-12 plus four supplemental tables). Table 1 shows the number of people who obtained lawful permanent resident status in the United States in each fiscal year from 1820 to 2024.

      To protect privacy, DHS rounds all values to the nearest 10.
    date_published: "2026-06-08"

    # Citation
    producer: US Department of Homeland Security
    citation_full: |-
      United States. Department of Homeland Security. 2024 Yearbook of Immigration Statistics. Washington, D.C.: U.S. Department of Homeland Security, Office of Homeland Security Statistics, 2026.
    attribution_short: DHS

    # Files
    url_main: https://ohss.dhs.gov/topics/immigration/yearbook/2024/table1
    # NOTE: the 2024 Yearbook also ships separate workbooks for refugees and asylees,
    # naturalizations, nonimmigrant admissions, and enforcement actions - not snapshotted (2026-07-22).
    url_download: https://ohss.dhs.gov/system/files/2026-06/2026_0604_ohss_yearbook_lawful_permanent_residents_fy2024.xlsx
    date_accessed: "2026-07-22"

